    main
      section.page-hero
        p.eyebrow
          span.eyebrow__rule
          |  More than a training log
        h1
          | Tools for the
          br
          em whole journey.
        p Explore sporting essentials, membership information, and connected training support.
      section.services-section#services
        .section-heading.section-heading--center.reveal
          p.eyebrow Marketplace overview
          h2
            | Training essentials
            br
            em for the journey.
          p Get an overview of apparel, practice materials, and protective gear. Contact us for current availability; this page is an overview, not a product catalog.
        .service-grid
          article.service-card.reveal#gear
            span.service-card__index 01 / APPAREL
            h3 Sport apparel
            p Ask about apparel and other sporting essentials for your training routine.
            a.card-link(href="contact.html")
              | Ask about availability 
              span(aria-hidden="true") ↗
          article.service-card.reveal
            span.service-card__index 02 / PRACTICE
            h3 Targets and training aids
            p Get in touch for information about practice materials and training resources.
            a.card-link(href="contact.html")
              | Ask our team 
              span(aria-hidden="true") ↗
          article.service-card.reveal
            span.service-card__index 03 / PROTECTION
            h3 Eye and ear protection
            p Contact us for current information about protective sporting essentials.
            a.card-link(href="contact.html")
              | Contact our team 
              span(aria-hidden="true") ↗
      section.services-section#membership
        .section-heading.section-heading--center.reveal
          p.eyebrow Membership information
          h2
            | Choose your diary
            br
            em membership.
          p Start with the free diary or choose Premium for ad-free use, advanced progress charts, and PDF or CSV exports. Prices and features below reflect the published app plans.
        .service-grid.membership-grid
          article.service-card.membership-card.reveal
            span.service-card__index FREE / BASIC
            h3 Free
            p.membership-card__price
              | ₹0 
              span to start
            ul.membership-card__features
              li Core practice and match diary
              li Notice board and circulars
              li Range reviews, community blogs, and rules library
              li Supported by ads
            a.card-link(href="contact.html")
              | Ask a question 
              span(aria-hidden="true") ↗
          article.service-card.membership-card.reveal
            span.service-card__index PREMIUM / MONTHLY
            h3 Premium Monthly
            p.membership-card__price
              | ₹99 
              span / month
            ul.membership-card__features
              li Everything in Free
              li No ads
              li Advanced progress charts
              li Diary export as PDF or CSV
            a.card-link(href="contact.html")
              | Ask about Premium 
              span(aria-hidden="true") ↗
          article.service-card.membership-card.membership-card--featured.reveal
            span.service-card__index PREMIUM / ANNUAL · BEST VALUE
            h3 Annual
            p.membership-card__price
              | ₹999 
              span / year
            ul.membership-card__features
              li Everything in Free
              li No ads
              li Advanced progress charts
              li Diary export as PDF or CSV
            a.card-link(href="contact.html")
              | Ask about Premium 
              span(aria-hidden="true") ↗
